      "statement": "SSH sign tokens are generated by the same provisioner dispatch as X.509 tokens via SignSSHToken (cert type, key ID, principals, validity), with SSH audiences /1.0/ssh/sign, /1.0/ssh/renew, /1.0/ssh/rekey, /1.0/ssh/revoke.",
