      "id": "claim_12a0bb3a62ab49eaa0812cac62818ff7",
      "statement": "step ssh login generates a key pair, requests a user certificate, and adds it to the SSH agent; without --force it checks the agent for a still-valid CA-signed certificate (filtered by the CA's user keys and expiration) and returns early when present; abc@def identities map to the abc principal.",
